// Fury / Explosion Spirits cast (MO_EXPLOSIONSPIRITS): the reference EF 261
// (EF_GUMGANG2) raises four flared ring_yellow cylinders around the caster 100ms
// apart, fading over ~0.6s, with a quake. Here each cylinder is a ring of
// trapezoid billboards (ring wall texture wrapped by uv), plus a warm flare at
// the body. The persistent buff look is EFST 86 (fury_sparks.strfx.ron). ~0.9s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
